@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@user = bob

### Everything waiting for the caller, across every resource type. Invites are created by sharing a
### resource - see shopping-lists.http for the share/unshare side.
GET {{baseUrl}}/invites
Authorization: Bearer {{user}}

### Fill this in with an id from the listing above
@inviteId = 762d240e-cb10-4fc1-b9c8-567d81db83d7

### Accept - the resource becomes visible to the caller with the role the invite carries
POST {{baseUrl}}/invites/{{inviteId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{user}}

### Decline - 204, the resource stays invisible and the invite is gone from both sides
POST {{baseUrl}}/invites/{{inviteId}}/decline
Authorization: Bearer {{user}}
